diff --git a/docs/cpp-dots-runtime/computation-pipelines.md b/docs/cpp-dots-runtime/computation-pipelines.md
index 1c3357b3..cef9a914 100644
--- a/docs/cpp-dots-runtime/computation-pipelines.md
